        <p>
          After successful login, users land on the Dashboard — a personalized hub displaying
          a welcome message, action cards for each feature, and a history of recent summaries.
        </p>
        <ul class="step-features">
          <li>Personalized welcome with user display name</li>
          <li>Three action cards: Upload PDF, Summarize Text, Mind Maps</li>
          <li>Recent summaries history with click-to-reload</li>
          <li>Logout button with session clearance</li>
          <li>Responsive card grid layout</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="step-media">
        <img src="/selenium_screenshots/05_dashboard.png" alt="Dashboard view" loading="lazy" />
        <div class="img-label">05_dashboard.png — Dashboard with action cards</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- STEP 3: PDF Upload -->
    <div class="step" data-step="3">
      <div class="step-text">
        <div class="step-number" style="background: rgba(255, 152, 0, 0.15); color: var(--orange);">03</div>
