          or pagination dots, and download all reels as images.
        </p>
        <ul class="step-features">
          <li>Swipeable card carousel with pagination</li>
          <li>Each reel has title, content, and key points</li>
          <li>Numbered indicators (1/6, 2/6, etc.)</li>
          <li>"Download All Reels" export feature</li>
          <li>Gradient card design with smooth transitions</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="step-media">
