        </p>
        <ul class="step-features">
          <li>D3.js radial tree with animated transitions</li>
          <li>Auto-generated from summary JSON data</li>
          <li>Zoom and pan with mouse/touch</li>
          <li>Color-coded nodes by hierarchy depth</li>
          <li>Responsive SVG rendering</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="step-media">
        <img src="/selenium_screenshots/17_mindmap_view.png" alt="Mind Map view" loading="lazy" />
        <div class="img-label">17_mindmap_view.png — D3.js radial mind map</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- STEP 8: AI Chat -->
    <div class="step" data-step="8">
      <div class="step-text">
        <div class="step-number" style="background: rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.15); color: #E74C3C;">08</div>
        <h3>AI Chat</h3>
        <div class="subtitle">Context-Aware Document Chatbot</div>
        <p>
          The AI Chat tab opens a context-aware chatbot that understands the uploaded document.
          Powered by a dual-engine architecture — Groq's Llama 3.1 for speed and Gemini for
          embeddings — it answers questions directly from your document content.
        </p>
        <ul class="step-features">
          <li>Chat interface with message bubbles</li>
          <li>Context injected from extracted PDF text</li>
          <li>Recommended question chips for quick queries</li>
          <li>Dual AI engine: Groq (speed) + Gemini (quality)</li>
          <li>Markdown rendering in chat responses</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="step-media">
        <img src="/selenium_screenshots/19_chat_view.png" alt="AI Chat view" loading="lazy" />
        <div class="img-label">19_chat_view.png — AI chatbot interface</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- STEP 9: Split Layout -->
    <div class="step" data-step="9">
      <div class="step-text">
        <div class="step-number" style="background: rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.15); color: #2196F3;">09</div>
        <h3>Split-Screen Layout</h3>
        <div class="subtitle">PDF + AI Analysis Side by Side</div>
        <p>
          The results view uses a 45/55 split layout — PDF preview on the left, AI-generated
